msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq102_03807:TEXT_BANQIQ102_03807_TODO_00:1"
msgid "<if ($n4 == 16)><if ($n1 < $n2)>Mine splendid flint stones in the K'mul Astropolis<else>Deliver the splendid flint stones to Qhoterl Pasol</if><else><if ($n4 == 17)><if ($n1 < $n2)>Gather splendid seeds in the K'mul Astropolis<else>Deliver the splendid seeds to Qhoterl Pasol</if><else><if ($n4 == 18)><if ($n1 < $n2)>Catch a splendid trout in the Red Chalice<else>Deliver the splendid trout to Qhoterl Pasol</if></if></if></if>."
msgstr ""

#. ja: わたくしどもの探索する地下洞窟は、光の差さぬ闇の世界～。<br>それゆえ、明かりがなければ発掘作業どころか、<br>歩くことすらままなりませぬ～！
#. de: Welt unter Erde ist total düster. Ohne gute Lampen sehen Grabende Pfoten eigene Hand vor Augen nicht.
#. fr: Qitari faire souuuvent explorations en sous-sol, mais tellement sombre que Qitari rien y voir<nbsp>! Sans souuurce de lumière, excavation très très difficile<nbsp>!
#. speaker: QHOTERLPASOL
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq102_03807:TEXT_BANQIQ102_03807_QHOTERLPASOL_000_000:1"
msgid "The underground caverns we explore are terribly dark places. Without some manner of illumination, we couldn't see our own whiskers, never mind go about our digging."
msgstr ""

#. ja: そこで、「<sheet Item 29518 0>」を3つ、<br>クムル星遺跡群で採ってきてくださいましな～。<br>光源の素材として使うため、お願いいたしまする～。
#. de: Du bringst für Lampen bitte drei <noun-de Item 5 29518 2 4 1> aus K'mul-Astropolis, ja? Du bist große Hilfe!
#. fr: Gentil<if $gn4>le</if> <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> aider Qitari et aller extraire trois <noun-fr Item 12 29518 2 1> à Astropole des K'mul<nbsp>! Après avoir ramené Ténèbres, toi ramener lumière, hi hi<nbsp>!
#. speaker: QHOTERLPASOL
#. macro: <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq102_03807:TEXT_BANQIQ102_03807_QHOTERLPASOL_000_010:1"
msgid "Would you be so kind, good <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if>, as to mine for me some flint in the K'mul Astropolis? The stones are necessary for striking a fire. Three or so should suffice splendidly."
msgstr ""

#. ja: そこで、「<sheet Item 29544 0>」を3つ、<br>クムル星遺跡群で採ってきてくださいましな～。<br>光源の素材として使うため、お願いいたしまする～。
#. de: Du bringst für Lampen bitte drei <noun-de Item 5 29544 2 4 1> aus K'mul-Astropolis, ja? Du bist große Hilfe!
#. fr: Gentil<if $gn4>le</if> <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> aider Qitari et aller récolter trois <noun-fr Item 12 29544 2 1> à Astropole des K'mul<nbsp>! Après avoir ramené Ténèbres, toi ramener lumière, hi hi<nbsp>!
#. speaker: QHOTERLPASOL
#. macro: <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq102_03807:TEXT_BANQIQ102_03807_QHOTERLPASOL_000_020:1"
msgid "Would you be so kind, good <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if>, as to gather for me some plant seeds in the K'mul Astropolis? From them we can extract an oil which we use as lamp fuel. Three bags' worth should suffice splendidly."
msgstr ""

#. ja: そこで、「<sheet Item 29570 0>」を、<br>血の酒坏で釣り上げてくださいましな～。<br>釣り餌は、<sheet Item 27582 0>が最適でございましょ～。
#. de: Du fängst für Lampen bitte <noun-de Item 5 29570 1 4 1> aus Blutkelch, ja? Fängst du am besten mit <noun-de Item 5 27582 1 3 1>. Du bist große Hilfe!
#. fr: Gentil<if $gn4>le</if> <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> aider Qitari et aller pêcher <noun-fr Item 12 29570 1 1> avec <noun-fr Item 12 27582 1 1> dans Calice rouge<nbsp>! Après avoir ramené Ténèbres, toi ramener lumière, hi hi<nbsp>!
#. speaker: QHOTERLPASOL
#. macro: <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq102_03807:TEXT_BANQIQ102_03807_QHOTERLPASOL_000_030:1"
msgid "Would you be so kind, good <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if>, as to catch for me a trout in the Red Chalice? From them we can extract an oil which we use as lamp fuel."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet Item 29518 0>」を3つ、<br>クムル星遺跡群で採ってきてくださいましな～。<br>光源の素材として使うため、お願いいたしまする～。
#. de: Du besorgst für Lampen drei <noun-de Item 5 29518 2 4 1> aus K'mul-Astropolis, ja?
#. fr: Gentil<if $gn4>le</if> <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> aider Qitari et aller extraire trois <noun-fr Item 12 29518 2 1> à Astropole des K'mul<nbsp>! Après avoir ramené Ténèbres, toi ramener lumière, hi hi<nbsp>!
#. speaker: QHOTERLPASOL
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq102_03807:TEXT_BANQIQ102_03807_QHOTERLPASOL_100_010:1"
msgid "Oh, there you are. May I ask how the flint stones are coming along? You'll have the best luck searching in the K'mul Astropolis."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet Item 29544 0>」を3つ、<br>クムル星遺跡群で採ってきてくださいましな～。<br>光源の素材として使うため、お願いいたしまする～。
