msgid "Oh, there you are. May I ask how the trout is coming along? You'll have the best luck searching in the Red Chalice."
msgstr ""

#. ja: お戻りになられましたか～。<br>素材集めの首尾は、いかがでしょ～？
#. de: Na, warst du erfolgreich?
#. fr: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> être de retouuur<nbsp>! Avoir ramené brillant brillant<nbsp>?
#. speaker: QHOTERLPASOL
#. macro: <if $gn4>Mistress<else>Master</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
