msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq102_03807:TEXT_BANQIQ102_03807_QHOTERLPASOL_000_040:1"
msgid "Welcome back, <if $gn4>Mistress<else>Master</if> <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>. Dare I hope you've obtained that which I seek?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: お見事にございまする～！<br>これだけあれば、ひとまずは十分でございましょ～！
#. de: Perfekt! Daraus machen Qitari helle Lampen, damit Grabende Pfoten unter Erde sehen können.
#. fr: Oh là là<nbsp>! Qhoterl Pasol être tellement éblouuuie<nbsp>! Risquer devenir aveuuugle<nbsp>!
#. speaker: QHOTERLPASOL
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq102_03807:TEXT_BANQIQ102_03807_QHOTERLPASOL_000_050:1"
msgid "Ah, splendid! This shall serve us well for several outings!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: わたくしどもキタリ族は、他種族に比べ視力が劣りますゆえ、<br>これらの素材で作る照明器具が、重要となるのでござりまする～。<br><split " " 1><string $gs1></split>殿には、感謝が尽きませぬ～。
#. de: Qitari haben ja nicht gerade beste Augen. Umso wichtiger sind gute Lampen. Also, tausend Dank für Hilfe!
#. fr: Qitari avoir faible vue par rapport à autres races. Dans noir, Qitari rien voir du tout du tout<nbsp>! Mais grâce à gentil<if $gn4>le</if> <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>, Qitari retrouuuver la vue, hi hi<nbsp>!
#. speaker: QHOTERLPASOL
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq102_03807:TEXT_BANQIQ102_03807_QHOTERLPASOL_000_051:1"
msgid "As you may have heard, we Qitari do not see as well as some other peoples, and must rely on such things to help us find our way in the dark. For this gift of sight, you have my heartfelt thanks."
msgstr ""
